div.p:
The following persons have been appointed as Experts of the Delegation:


Major-General P. T. Mow, Deputy Director of the Commission on
                            Aeronautical Affairs and concurrently Director of the Washington Office
                            of the Commission on Aeronautical Affairs

Rear Admiral Liu Ten-fu, Naval Attaché of the Chinese Embassy,
                            Washington, D.C.;

Major-General Chu Shih-ming, Military Attaché of the Chinese Embassy,
                            Washington, D.C.;

Mr. Pu Hsueh-Feng, Counselor of the Supreme Defense Council;

Dr. Chang Chung-fu, Director of the Department of American Affairs of
                            the Ministry of Foreign Affairs;

Mr. T. L. Soong, Delegate to the United Nations Monetary and Financial
                            Conference;

Mr. Liu Chieh, Minister-Counselor, Chinese Embassy, Washington,
                            D.C.;

Dr. Kan Lee, Commercial Counselor, Chinese Embassy, Washington,
                            D.C.
